  "conclusion": "The Aave routes bind permit owner to the executing wallet but provide only v/r/s; they cannot transport PQSmartWallet's required C10 wrapper. Current implementations catch the failed permit and duplicate already-admitted non-permit paths when prior allowance exists, so the permit variants remain hard-refused."
